43	  <h3>What the session adds</h3>
44	  <dl class="kv">
45	    <dt>Runs mapping</dt><dd><code>m_FL_JS_STAGING_FULL</code> <a class="L">L811</a></dd>
46	    <dt>Writes STG_ORDERS through</dt><dd>connection <code>STG_Jaffleshop</code> <a class="L">L4587</a>. The session itself says <code>MART_Jaffleshop</code> <a class="L">L912</a>, but the workflow's <a class="term" data-term="task-instance">task instance</a> overrides it, and the override wins. (Only names; the details live outside the file.)</dd>
47	    <dt>Load type</dt><dd>Bulk <a class="L">L913</a></dd>
48	    <dt>Truncate target first?</dt><dd>The session option says NO <a class="L">L919</a>, but the target's <a class="term" data-term="pre-sql">Pre SQL</a> empties it anyway: <code>TRUNCATE TABLE STG.STG_ORDERS</code> <a class="L">L541</a>. So every run is a full reload.</dd>
